{"id": "gsm8k_train_1299", "text": "To determine the total number of weeds Sarah pulled, we need to calculate the number of weeds she pulled each day and then sum them up.\n\n1. **Tuesday:**\n   Sarah pulled 25 weeds.\n\n2. **Wednesday:**\n   She pulled three times the number of weeds she did on Tuesday.\n   \\[\n   3 \\times 25 = 75 \\text{ weeds}\n   \\]\n\n3. **Thursday:**\n   She pulled one-fifth of the weeds she pulled on Wednesday.\n   \\[\n   \\frac{75}{5} = 15 \\text{ weeds}\n   \\", "prompt_tokens": 139, "generated_tokens": 128, "token_ids": [1249, 8253, 279, 2790, 1372, 315, 69435, 20445, 13238, 11, 582, 1184, 311, 11047, 279, 1372, 315, 69435, 1340, 13238, 1817, 1899, 323, 1221, 2629, 1105, 705, 382, 16, 13, 3070, 40199, 25, 1019, 256, 20445, 13238, 220, 17, 20, 69435, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 40519, 25, 1019, 256, 2932, 13238, 2326, 3039, 279, 1372, 315, 69435, 1340, 1521, 389, 7589, 624, 256, 1124, 9640, 256, 220, 18, 1124, 15136, 220, 17, 20, 284, 220, 22, 20, 1124, 1318, 90, 69435, 532, 256, 1124, 2533, 18, 13, 3070, 37788, 25, 1019, 256, 2932, 13238, 825, 2220, 57610, 315, 279, 69435, 1340, 13238, 389, 7920, 624, 256, 1124, 9640, 256, 1124, 37018, 90, 22, 20, 15170, 20, 92, 284, 220, 16, 20, 1124, 1318, 90, 69435, 532, 256, 1124], "stopped_eos": false, "truncated": true, "seconds": 22.878316289000054, "tokens_per_second": 5.594817310115722, "actual_cache_tensor_bytes": 6561792, "actual_cache_dtype": "torch.float32", "peak_cuda_allocated_bytes": null, "memory": {"packed_payload_bytes": 0, "metadata_bytes": 0, "floating_buffer_bytes": 3280896.0, "estimated_total_bytes": 3280896.0, "reference_cache_bytes": 3280896.0, "estimated_compression": 1.0, "effective_bits_including_overhead": 16.0, "quantized_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 267, "projection_reference_bits": 16}, "blocks": [], "signals": [{"position": 139, "entropy": 0.15267413854599, "margin": 0.32071876525878906}, {"position": 140, "entropy": 0.1173738706856966, "margin": 1.1478507995605467}, {"position"